node_modules/
# This repo has no root npm project (the npm project is frontend/). Ignore an
# accidental root package-lock.json so it can't be re-committed — running an npm
# command at the repo root would otherwise strand an empty lockfile that breaks
# `npm ci` there. Anchored (leading /) so frontend/package-lock.json is untouched.
/package-lock.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
dist/
